  class lg0 blue
  class lg1 yellow
  class lg2 purple
  class lg3 mayBreak
  class lg4 bugPath
  s0: Open
  s1: Claimed
  s2: Claimed #183; submit in progress
  s3: Submitted, in review
  s4: Submitted, in review #183; creator decision in progress
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: a builder claims the task
  s1 --> s2: a builder sends in work
  s2 --> s3: the submission is saved
  s3 --> s4: the creator opens the submission
  s4 --> s4: the creator accepts the submission
